          "title": "You'll want to know: la jalousie",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la jalousie — \"jealousy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La jalousie a gâché leur amitié. Jealousy spoilt their friendship."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on jaloux. Also a slatted blind on a window."
            }
          ]
        },
