          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la jalousie is built on jaloux (EtymDB), which goes back to Late Latin zēlōsus \"full of zeal\", from zēlus, a borrowing from Greek zêlos \"zeal, rivalry\"."
            }
          ]
        },
